亂及尉繚說秦王的連續敘事，官稱與引用中大王指在位秦王政，不跨篇套用。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m010-0350","start":350,"end":351,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"ao3_0fy_d45_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"限嫪毐亂及尉繚說秦王的連續敘事，官稱與引用中大王指在位秦王政，不跨篇套用。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m010-0354","start":354,"end":356,"surface":"太后","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官稱或句讀疑問待核；不補造姓名或直接同稱合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m010-0373","start":373,"end":374,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"ao3_0fy_d45_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"限嫪毐亂及尉繚說秦王的連續敘事，官稱與引用中大王指在位秦王政，不跨篇套用。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m010-0376","start":376,"end":378,"surface":"太后","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官稱或句讀疑問待核；不補造姓名或直接同稱合併。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","book_id":"b-shiji-006","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p012","text":"十一年，王翦、桓齮、楊端和攻鄴，取九城。王翦攻閼與、橑楊，皆并為一軍。翦將十八日，軍歸斗食以下，什推二人從軍取鄴安陽，桓齮將。十二年，文信侯不韋死，竊葬。其舍人臨者，晉人也逐出之；秦人六百石以上奪爵，遷；五百石以下不臨，遷，勿奪爵。自今以來，操國事不道如嫪毐、不韋者籍其門，視此。秋，復嫪毐舍人遷蜀者。當是之時，天下大旱，六月至八月乃雨。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m012-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"王翦","kind":"person","person_id":"gdj_k53_v1x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m012-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"桓齮","kind":"person","person_id":"42c_0ck_iry","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m012-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"楊端和","kind":"person","person_id":"82f_v64_vcn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m012-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"王翦","kind":"person","person_id":"gdj_k53_v1x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m012-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"翦","kind":"person","person_id":"gdj_k53_v1x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m012-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"桓齮","kind":"person","person_id":"42c_0ck_iry","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m012-0067","start":67,"end":72,"surface":"文信侯不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"puu_6hs_m4f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m012-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"舍人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官稱或句讀疑問待核；不補造姓名或直接同稱合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m012-0127","start":127,"end":129,"surface":"嫪毐","kind":"person","person_id":"hzt_j3d_1r3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m012-0130","start":130,"end":132,"surface":"不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"puu_6hs_m4f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m012-0143","start":143,"end":145,"surface":"嫪毐","kind":"person","person_id":"hzt_j3d_1r3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m012-0145","start":145,"end":147,"surface":"舍人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官稱或句讀疑問待核；不補造姓名或直接同稱合併。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","book_id":"b-shiji-006","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p013","text":"十三年，桓齮攻趙平陽，殺趙將扈輒，斬首十萬。王之河南。正月，彗星見東方。十月，桓齮攻趙。十四年，攻趙軍於平陽，取宜安，破之，殺其將軍。桓齮定平陽、武城。韓非使秦，秦用李斯謀，留非，非死雲陽。韓王請為臣。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m013-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"桓齮","kind":"person","person_id":"42c_0ck_iry","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m013-0012","start":12,"end":16,"surface":"趙將扈輒","kind":"person","person_id":"c2a_8kr_ki8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m013-0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"ao3_0fy_d45_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"依本段明示主體限定；代王承趙公子嘉，後一荊王承項燕立昌平君，先前被俘荊王不合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m013-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"桓齮","kind":"person","person_id":"42c_0ck_iry","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m013-0063","start":63,"end":66,"surface":"其將軍","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官稱或句讀疑問待核；不補造姓名或直接同稱合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m013-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"桓齮","kind":"person","person_id":"42c_0ck_iry","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m013-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"韓非","kind":"person","person_id":"n2o_l90_fnm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m013-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"李斯","kind":"person","person_id":"49g_7az_e4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m013-0088","start":88,"end":89,"surface":"非","kind":"person","person_id":"n2o_l90_fnm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m013-0090","start":90,"end":91,"surface":"非","kind":"person","person_id":"n2o_l90_fnm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m013-0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"韓王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官稱或句讀疑問待核；不補造姓名或直接同稱合併。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","book_id":"b-shiji-006","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p025","text":"趙悼襄王元年，廉頗既亡入魏，趙使李牧攻燕，拔武遂、方城。居二年，龐暖破燕軍，殺劇辛。後七年，秦破殺趙將扈輒於武遂，斬首十萬。趙乃以李牧爲大將軍，撃秦軍於宜安，大破秦軍，走秦將桓齮。封李牧爲武安君。居三年，秦攻番吾，李牧撃破秦軍，南距韓、魏。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m025-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"趙悼襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"q6w_qm5_w2b_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m025-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"tfz_fnj_ejn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m025-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"李牧","kind":"person","person_id":"hph_y6n_3zb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m025-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"龐暖","kind":"person","person_id":"0p4_ef2_1xa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m025-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"劇辛","kind":"person","person_id":"bkf_68m_hxl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m025-0049","start":49,"end":53,"surface":"趙將扈輒","kind":"person","person_id":"vo2_2ho_kyz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m025-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"李牧","kind":"person","person_id":"hph_y6n_3zb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m025-0085","start":85,"end":89,"surface":"秦將桓齮","kind":"person","person_id":"42c_0ck_iry","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m025-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"李牧","kind":"person","person_id":"hph_y6n_3zb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m025-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"李牧","kind":"person","person_id":"hph_y6n_3zb","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin","book_id":"b-shiji-081","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-081-lianlin"}],"table_passages":[{"id":"shiji-015-r243-c01","column":1,"rowspan":1,"colspan":2,"text":"十三。桓齮擊平陽，殺趙扈輒，斬首十萬，因東擊。趙王之河南。彗星見。","source_row":244,"source_column":2,"printed_page":null,"person_mentions":[{"id":"shiji-015-r243-c01-m003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"桓齮","person_id":"42c_0ck_iry","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依國別、紀年及原格上下文暫定；保留異文，不據同名自動合併。"},{"id":"shiji-015-r243-c01-m010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"趙扈輒","person_id":"c2a_8kr_ki8","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依國別、紀年及原格上下文暫定；保留異文，不據同名自動合併。"}],"table_id":"shiji-015","table_fragment_id":"shiji-015-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-015-r243","table_cell_id":"shiji-015-r243-c01","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-015","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-015","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-015","source_revision"